/* ============================================================================
 * Theme: sakura — Hand-drawn dashed borders, delicate pink palette
 * ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * Structurally: cards use DASHED borders (1.5px, soft pink), no
 * shadow — the card looks sketched onto the page rather than rendered.
 * Body bg has a hand-drawn cherry-blossom petal scatter via repeating
 * radial dots. Border-radius is small and consistent. Japanese-
 * minimalist with hand-drawn warmth.
